  "question": {
    "text": "The distance travelled by a particle is related to time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. The velocity of the particle at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> is",
